\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces PLAA state pipeline with multiplicative FiLM. The latent state $S_t$ gates the feature amplitude of frozen transformer layers $16$--$28$; the output hidden state $h_t$ updates the state via a GRU cell, producing $S_{t+1}$ for the next turn. The dashed loop is the persistence channel that makes $S_t$ the only cross-turn carrier.}}{2}{figure.1}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:architecture}{{1}{2}{PLAA state pipeline with multiplicative FiLM. The latent state $S_t$ gates the feature amplitude of frozen transformer layers $16$--$28$; the output hidden state $h_t$ updates the state via a GRU cell, producing $S_{t+1}$ for the next turn. The dashed loop is the persistence channel that makes $S_t$ the only cross-turn carrier}{figure.1}{}}
